#
#   navigable_container_taken_ahead - HTML::NavigableContainer: the registry of containers
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/HTML/NavigableContainer.cpp's all_instances (lines 29-33) and
#       navigable_container_with_content_navigable (lines 55-62), taken ahead of region r28 by
#       region r43 for Navigable::container. Region r28 ports the rest of NavigableContainer
#       (its constructor and finalize keep the registry) around them.
